/-!
Runtime-exported finite window certificate artifact.

Generated by:
`cargo run --bin export_window_certificate -- --p 5 --base 10 --window-span 5 --exclude-radius 1 --out lean-proofs/PrimeArithmetic/Generated/Examples/WindowP5Base10Span5.lean`

- midpoint: `50`
- window span: `5`
- exclusion radius: `1`
- prime positions: `[47, 53]`
